      "worked": "The working fails to check the candidates in the original equation. Line (5) also uses degrees although the interval is in radians. The candidates are $x=\\frac{3\\pi}{4}$ and $x=\\frac{7\\pi}{4}$. $$\\begin{align*}2x&=\\frac{3\\pi}{2}\\quad\\text{or}\\quad\\frac{7\\pi}{2}\\end{align*}$$ At both values, $\\tan2x$ is undefined, so neither satisfies the original equation. There are no solutions.",
